codex
The extracted regression is broader than the two headline constants: the old engine carried long crossfades/retirement, a 3.4-second reverb with a 0.55 return, and register-specific defaults across the synth voices. I’m restoring that whole posture explicitly (including the inharmonic bell), while leaving `src/engine/band.js` byte-identical to the synced House Band kit. The strum will again use one seeded hand drag plus an ordered 2–5 ms string spread; pluck’s generic timing jitter will be disabled so the kit cannot invert that order.
